            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis kondisi agar loop berjalan sampai variabel penghitung mencapai <code>5</code>, tetapi tidak mencetak <code>5</code> di konsol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>; i &gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
